Description: Exercise timeout selection with a loopback DNS mock
 The default-channel test attempts to send to the builder's external DNS
 server. Without external routes the send can fail synchronously, leaving
 no timer to inspect. Move the test to the existing IPv4/IPv6 UDP mock
 fixture and verify query completion without external network access.
